{"request_uuid": "a5a0a341-67dd-4fe9-88b6-c2c5702db363", "timestamp": "2026-11-24T09:02:26.161487+00:00", "level": "DEBUG", "mode": "implementation", "workspace_folder": "loan-payments", "mac_id": "5c:9b:a6:82:ff:92", "type": "tool_execution_update", "toolCallId": "call_01a20ccac8817983a4e9801b", "toolName": "bash", "args": {"command": "cd /opt/datasqrl-examples/user_analytics/creditcard_rewards-api/tests && for f in *.graphql *.properties; do echo \"=== $f ===\"; cat \"$f\"; echo; done"}, "partialResult": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "=== CardRequestCustomer2.graphql ===\nmutation {\n  CardRequest(event: {cardType: \"sports\"}) {\n    customerId\n    cardType\n  }\n}\n\n=== CardRequest.graphql ===\nmutation {\n  CardRequest(event: {cardType: \"travel\"}) {\n    customerId\n    cardType\n  }\n}\n\n=== MyCardRequestsCustomer2.graphql ===\nquery {\n  MyCardRequests {\n    customerId\n    cardType\n  }\n}\n\n=== MyCardRequests.graphql ===\nquery {\n  MyCardRequests {\n    customerId\n    cardType\n  }\n}\n\n=== PotentialRewards.graphql ===\nquery {\n  PotentialRewardsByDay {\n    customerId\n    cardType\n    timeDay\n    total_reward\n  }\n}\n\n=== RewardsByDay.graphql ===\nquery {\n  RewardsByDay {\n    customerId\n    timeDay\n    total_reward\n  }\n}\n\n=== RewardsWithSupportRole.graphql ===\nquery {\n  Rewards(fromTime: \"2024-04-26T00:00:00Z\", toTime: \"2024-06-26T00:00:00Z\") {\n    customerId\n    cardNo\n    amount\n    reward\n    time\n  }\n}\n\n=== test-customerId-2.graphql ===\nquery {\n  RewardsByDay {\n    customerId\n    timeDay\n    total_reward\n  }\n  PotentialRewardsByDay {\n    customerId\n    cardType\n    timeDay\n    total_reward\n  }\n  TotalPotentialReward {\n    customerId\n    cardType\n    total_reward\n    since_time\n  }\n}\n\n=== TotalPotentialReward.graphql ===\nquery {\n  TotalPotentialReward {\n    customerId\n    cardType\n    total_reward\n    since_time\n  }\n}\n\n=== CardRequestCustomer2.properties ===\nAuthorization: Be