_PACKAGE_PREFIX. If unset, git. So in the agent (this container), the harness must set SQRL_PACKAGE_PREFIX. The env var isn't set in my interactive shell, but the harness may set it when running the final command. Actually, the note in the template says \"Inside the DataSQRL agent the mount root is the repository... reached with the prefix the orchestrator exports\". Hmm, but here the mount at /workspace is the whole repo, and WORKSPACE_DIR is the project. The orchestrator exports SQRL_PACKAGE_PREFIX presumably.\n\nLet me check the agent context file /workspace/loan-payments/.datasqrl/datasqrl-agent-context.txt for SQRL_PACKAGE_PREFIX."}}
