 "reasoning": 115, "totalTokens": 189407, "cost": {"input": 4.62e-05, "output": 0.0002364, "cacheRead": 0.001134336, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.001416936}}, "stopReason": "toolUse", "timestamp": 1795511345731, "responseId": "dbf9d20fd679490f9331daf4e6e92ed2-aws_ec1", "rawStopReason": "tool_calls", "durationMs": 1362, "thinkingLevel": "high"}, {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_01a20cd0e70c78129d905434", "toolName": "bash", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "./AGENTS.md\n./.datasqrl_agent_results.json\n./loan-payments-api/operations.v1.graphql\n./loan-payments-api/schema.v1.graphqls\n./loan-payments-api-test-package.json\n./loan-payments-api/tests/customer-loans.graphql\n./loan-payments-api/tests/customer-loans.properties\n./loan-payments-api/tests/loan-late-fees.graphql\n./loan-payments-api/tests/loan-late-fees.properties\n./loan-payments-api/tests/loan-summary-returned.graphql\n./loan-payments-api/tests/loan-summary-returned.properties\n./loan-payments-api/tests/missing-token.graphql\n./loan-payments-api/tests/payment-returned.graphql\n./loan-payments-api/tests/payment-returned.properties\n./loan-payments-api/tests/wrong-customer-payments.graphql\n./loan-payments-api/tests/wrong-customer-payments.properties\n./loan-payments-api/tests/wrong-customer-summary.graphql\n./loan-payments-api/tests/wrong-customer-summary.properties\n./loan-payments-api/tests/zero-payment-loan.graphql\n./loan-payments-api/tests/zero-payment-loan.properties\n./loan-payments-prod-package.json\n./loan-payments-shared-package.json\n./loan-payments.sqrl\n./loan-payments-table-test-package.json\n./README.md\n./run-tests.sh\n./snapshots/loan-payments/customer-loans.snapshot\n./snapshots/loan-payments/loan-late-fees.snapshot\n./snapshots/loan-payments/loan-summary-returned.snapshot\n./snapshots/loan-payments/missing-token.snapshot\n./snapshots/loan-payments/payment-returned.snapshot\n./snapshots/loan-payments_table_test/LoanPaymentsCountTest.snapshot\n./snapshots/loan-payments_table_test/ZeroPaymentSummaryTest.snapshot\n./snapshots/loan-payments/wrong-customer-payments.snapshot\n./snapshots/loan-payments/wrong-customer-summary.snapshot\n./snapshots/loan-payments/zero-payment-loan.snapshot\n"}], "isError": false, "durationMs": 31, "timestamp": 1795511347126}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The implementation is complete. All 13 tests pass (8 API tests + 5 table tests), both test and prod configs compile, and all plan steps are done.\n\nSummary of what was built in `loan-payments/`:\n- **Sources**: imports the shared `data-catalog` consumer-loan tables via `script.include` \u2014 no copied or redeclared sources.\n- **Processing** (`loan-payments.sqrl`): latest-version CDC dedup by `source_updated_at`, personal-only payment filter, loan enrichment, and a left-joined applied/returned aggregation anchored on all personal loans (so payment-free loans get zero counts and a null last payment date).\n- **API**: custom GraphQL schema plus REST/MCP operations for `LoanPaymentSummary(loan_id)`, `LoanPayments(loan_id)`, and `CustomerLoans`, with `customer_id` injected from the JWT claim and never caller-visible.\n- **Auth**: Vert.x `auth` providers in the test and prod overlays (HS256 test secret; `${AUTH_ISSUER}`/`${AUTH_AUDIENCE}`/`${JWT_SECRET}` in prod).\n- **Tests**: API tests for the returned payment, late fees, zero-payment loan, the four-loan customer, wrong-customer and missing-token cases; plus inferred-schema table tests for row counts, no auto-loan leakage, and key uniqueness.\n- **Docs**: README covering sources, architecture, API, authorization, FR-8-by-construction, and the no-new-DQ decision.\n\n./run-tests.sh"}], "api": "openai-completions", "provider": "together", "model": "deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash", "usage": {"input": 611, "output": 340, "cacheRead": 189312, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 0, "totalTokens": 190263, "cost": {"input": 0.00018329999999999998, "output": 0.000408, "cacheRead": 0.001135872, "cache