{"request_uuid": "a5a0a341-67dd-4fe9-88b6-c2c5702db363", "timestamp": "2026-11-24T09:13:51.353368+00:00", "level": "INFO", "mode": "implementation", "workspace_folder": "loan-payments", "mac_id": "5c:9b:a6:82:ff:92", "source": "judge", "message": "Judge tests: 6 issue(s)", "name": "tests", "issue_count": 6, "issues": [{"severity": "LOW", "description": "CustomerLoansSource table definition has no test coverage and no downstream tables or functions that are tested; add a /*+test */ snapshot or no_rows test for CustomerLoansSource.", "location": "consumer_loans.sqrl", "verifier": "tests"}, {"severity": "LOW", "description": "CustomerLoans API query (which filters CustomerLoansSource by customer_id) has no test coverage; no GraphQL test query or downstream consumer exercises it.", "location": "consumer_loans.sqrl", "verifier": "tests"}, {"severity": "LOW", "description": "LoanPayments API query definition itself is untested; only its underlying LoanPaymentsSource is covered, so filter/order semantics of the query are not verified.", "location": "consumer_loans.sqrl", "verifier": "tests"}, {"severity": "LOW", "description": "LoanPaymentSummary API query definition itself is untested; only its underlying LoanPaymentSummarySource is covered, so the loan_id/customer_id filter is not verified.", "location": "consumer_loans.sqrl", "verifier": "tests"}, {"severity": "LOW", "description": "The source tables Auto_Loan, Loan_Application and Consumer_Loan_Delinquency_Event have no dedicated tests and no tested downstream consumers; the AutoLoanLeakTest only asserts absence of auto loans inside LoanPaymentsSource (which already filters loan_type='PERSONAL') and does not exercise Auto_Loan directly.", "location": "consumer_loans.sqrl", "verifier": "tests"}, {"severity": "LOW", "description": "Runner performs no setup hook to generate or download the fixtures referenced by ${DATA_PATH} (consumer_loans-*.jsonl); the source connectors require these files, so a clean checkout cannot reproduce the test run. Add a guarded setup step (e.g. scripts/generate-testdata.sh under the $LIST guard).", "location": "run-tests.sh", "verifier": "tests"}], "cost_usd": 0.003542376, "duration_ms": 3866}
