{"request_uuid": "a5a0a341-67dd-4fe9-88b6-c2c5702db363", "timestamp": "2026-11-24T09:26:53.837171+00:00", "level": "DEBUG", "mode": "implementation", "workspace_folder": "loan-payments", "mac_id": "5c:9b:a6:82:ff:92", "type": "message_start", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_01a20ce12d9475f184b1a5a7", "toolName": "edit", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Successfully replaced 1 block(s) in /workspace/loan-payments/README.md."}], "details": {"diff": "     ...\n 138 ## Tests\n 139 \n 140 The tests read the catalog test data through the catalog test connectors; the project adds no\n 141 source data. API tests and table tests live in two packages because each `sqrl test` run uses\n-142 one schema:\n+142 one schema. The three public functions (`LoanPaymentSummary`, `LoanPayments`, `CustomerLoans`) are\n+143 exercised through the custom schema by the API tests below, so their claim filter and ordering are\n+144 covered even though a `/*+test*/` table cannot inject the JWT claim:\n 143 \n 144 | Sub-project | Test package | Schema | Runs |\n 145 |---|---|---|---|\n 146 | `loan-payments` | `loan-payments-api-test-package.json` | custom (`use-inferred-schema: false`) | the API tests in `loan-payments-api/tests/` |\n     ...", "patch": "--- /workspace/loan-payments/README.md\n+++ /workspace/loan-payments/README.md\n@@ -138,9 +138,11 @@\n ## Tests\n \n The tests read the catalog test data through the catalog test connectors; the project adds no\n source data. API tests and table tests live in two packages because each `sqrl test` run uses\n-one schema:\n+one schema. The three public functions (`LoanPaymentSummary`, `LoanPayments`, `CustomerLoans`) are\n+exercised through the custom schema by the API tests below, so their claim filter and ordering are\n+covered even though a `/*+test*/` table cannot inject the JWT claim:\n \n | Sub-project | Test package | Schema | Runs |\n |---|---|---|---|\n | `loan-payments` | `loan-payments-api-test-package.json` | custom (`use-inferred-schema: false`) | the API tests in `loan-payments-api/tests/` |\n", "firstChangedLine": 142}, "isError": false, "durationMs": 5, "timestamp": 1795512413837}}
