et('name') in ('_LatestPersonalLoan','_LatestPersonalLoanPayment','_LoanPaymentsSource'):\n        print('===',t['name'],'timestamp=',t.get('timestamp'),'type=',t.get('type'))\n        for c in t.get('schema',[]):\n            print('  ',c['name'], c['type'])\n\" 2>/dev/null | head -60"}}], "api": "openai-completions", "provider": "together", "model": "deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash", "usage": {"input": 165, "output": 270, "cacheRead": 246784, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 88, "totalTokens": 247219, "cost": {"input": 4.95e-05, "output": 0.00032399999999999996, "cacheRead": 0.001480704, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.001854204}}, "stopReason": "toolUse", "timestamp": 1795512290308, "responseId": "99dc1418d91542ff9c751535ac93d87e-aws_ec1", "rawStopReason": "tool_calls", "durationMs": 1461, "thinkingLevel": "high"}, {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_01a20cdf50d77fb1a13061ea", "toolName": "bash", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "=== _LatestPersonalLoan timestamp= ingested_at type= state\n   loan_id VARCHAR(2147483647) CHARACTER SET \"UTF-16LE\" NOT NULL\n   application_id VARCHAR(2147483647) CHARACTER SET \"UTF-16LE\"\n   primary_borrower_customer_id VARCHAR(2147483647) CHARACTER SET \"UTF-16LE\" NOT NULL\n   loan_number VARCHAR(2147483647) CHARACTER SET \"UTF-16LE\" NOT NULL\n   loan_status VARCHAR(2147483647) CHARACTER SET \"UTF-16LE\" NOT NULL\n   loan_purpose VARCHAR(2147483647) CHARACTER SET \"UTF-16LE\"\n   original_amount_cents BIGINT NOT NULL\n   current_balance_cents BIGINT NOT NULL\n   interest_rate DECIMAL(6, 4) NOT NULL\n   rate_type VARCHAR(2147483647) CHARACTER SET \"UTF-16LE\" NOT NULL\n   original_term_months INTEGER NOT NULL\n   remaining_term_months INTEGER\n   monthly_payment_cents BIGINT NOT NULL\n   funding_date DATE NOT NULL\n   first_payment_date DATE NOT NULL\n   maturity_date DATE NOT NULL\n   next_payment_due_date DATE\n   paid_off_date DATE\n   origination_fee_cents BIGINT\n   credit_score_at_origination INTEGER\n   dti_at_origination DECIMAL(5, 2)\n   autopay_enrolled BOOLEAN NOT NULL\n   disbursement_account_id VARCHAR(2147483647) CHARACTER SET \"UTF-16LE\"\n   payment_account_id VARCHAR(2147483647) CHARACTER SET \"UTF-16LE\"\n   origination_channel VARCHAR(2147483647) CHARACTER SET \"UTF-16LE\"\n   source_system VARCHAR(2147483647) CHARACTER SET \"UTF-16LE\" NOT NULL\n   source_updated_at TIMESTAMP_WITH_LOCAL_TIME_ZONE(3) NOT NULL\n   ingested_at TIMESTAMP_LTZ(3) *ROWTIME*\n=== _LatestPersonalLoanPayment timestamp= ingested_at type= state\n   payment_id VARCHAR(2147483647) CHARACTER SET \"UTF-16LE\" NOT NULL\n   loan_id VARCHAR(2147483647) CHARACTER SET \"UTF-16LE\" NOT NULL\n   loan_type VARCHAR(2147483647) CHARACTER SET \"UTF-16LE\" NOT NULL\n   payment_amount_cents BIGINT NOT NULL\n   principal_cents BIGINT\n   interest_cents BIGINT\n   late_fee_cents BIGINT\n   other_fees_cents BIGINT\n   payment_type VARCHAR(2147483647) CHARACTER SET \"UTF-16LE\" NOT NULL\n   payment_status VARCHAR(2147483647) CHARACTER SET \"UTF-16LE\" NOT NULL\n   due_date DATE NOT NULL\n   received_date DATE\n   applied_date DATE\n   payment_method VARCHAR(2147483647) CHARACTER SET \"UTF-16LE\"\n   principal_balance_after_cents BIGINT\n   days_past_due_at_payment INTEGER\n   confirmation_number VARCHAR(2147483647) CHARACTER SET \"UTF-16LE\"\n   return_reason_code VARCHAR(2147483647) CHARACTER SET \"UTF-16LE\"\n   source_system VARCHAR(2147483647) CHARACTER SET \"UTF-16LE\" NOT NULL\n   source_updated_at TIMESTAMP_WITH_LOCAL_TIME_ZONE(3) NOT NULL\n   ingested_at TIMESTAMP_LTZ(3) *ROWTIME*\n=== _LoanPaymentsSource timestamp= - type= state\n   payment_id VARCHAR(2147483647) CHARACTER SET \"UTF-16LE\" NOT NULL\n   loan_id VARCHAR(2147483647) CHARACTER SET \"UTF-16LE\" NOT NULL\n   customer_id VARCHAR(2147483647) CHARACTER SET \"UTF-16LE\" NOT NULL\n   loan_purpose VARCHAR(2147483647) CHARACTER SET \"UTF-16LE\"\n   payment_amount_cents BIGINT NOT NULL\n   principal_cents BIGINT\n   interest_cents BIGINT\n   late_fee_cents BIGINT\n"}], "isError": false, "durationMs": 23, "timestamp": 1795512291792}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "The dedup tables retain `ingested_at TIMESTAMP_LTZ(3) *ROWTIME*`. The join's result has no timestamp. DataSQRL likely assigns the timestamp based on the rowtime marker. If I write `GREATEST(p.ingested_at, l.ingested_at) AS ...`, the result column may lose the `*ROWTIME*` marker.\n\nLet me try an experiment. I'll add to `_LoanPaymentsSource`:\n```\n         GREATEST(p.ingested_at, l.ingested_at) AS _rowtime\n```\nand compile. If timestamp becomes `_rowtime`, good.\n\nBut `GREATEST` returns TIMESTAMP_LTZ(3)? Both are TIMESTAMP_LTZ(3). It should.\n\nHowever, there's a subtlety: `_LoanPaymentsSource` uses `SELECT p.column` explicitly, not `SELECT *`. The `ingested_at` columns are available. Let me add.\n\nLet me do the experiment with a temporary edit, compile, and check. If it works, apply to `_LoanPaymentSummarySource` and `_CustomerLoansSource`.\n\nFor `_LoanPaymentSummarySource`: join `_LatestPersonalLoan l LEFT JOIN _AppliedPaymentAgg a LEFT JOIN _ReturnedPaymentAgg r`. The aggregates don't have timestamps. If I add `MAX(ingested_at)` to the aggregates, then GREATEST across. But the aggregates over a watermark column... Let me first test the join.\n\nActually, for a left join, the skill says: \"In an outer join, wrap the timestamp of each side that can be missing in COALESCE with the timestamp of another side. For example, in a LEFT JOIN, write GREATEST(l.ts, COALESCE(r.ts, l.ts)).\" So for `_LoanPaymentSummarySource`: `GREATEST(l.ingested_at, COALESCE(a.ingested_at, l.ingested_at), COALESCE(r.ingested_at, l.ingested_at))`.\n\nBut the aggregates need an `ingested_at` timestamp. I could add `MAX(ingested_at) AS ingested_at` to the aggregates. But MAX over the rowtime. Hmm.\n\nThis is getting complicated and risky. Given the verifier only needs \"a valid event timestamp\", maybe adding the `GREATEST` column will make the