{"request_uuid": "a5a0a341-67dd-4fe9-88b6-c2c5702db363", "timestamp": "2026-11-24T09:32:41.203475+00:00", "level": "INFO", "mode": "implementation", "workspace_folder": "loan-payments", "mac_id": "5c:9b:a6:82:ff:92", "source": "judge", "message": "Judge tests: 7 issue(s)", "name": "tests", "issue_count": 7, "issues": [{"severity": "LOW", "description": "The LoanPayments relationship function has no direct test. The tests only exercise the internal _LoanPaymentsSource table, so the function's loan_id/customer_id auth filter, metadata injection and ORDER BY are untested.", "location": "loan-payments.sqrl", "verifier": "tests"}, {"severity": "LOW", "description": "The LoanPaymentSummary relationship function has no direct test. DuplicateLoanSummaryTest/ZeroPaymentSummaryTest target the internal _LoanPaymentSummarySource table and do not exercise the function's loan_id + customer_id filter or its null-return behavior.", "location": "loan-payments.sqrl", "verifier": "tests"}, {"severity": "LOW", "description": "The CustomerLoans relationship function has no direct test. CustomerLoansSourceTest targets the internal _CustomerLoansSource table but does not exercise the function's customer_id filter or ORDER BY.", "location": "loan-payments.sqrl", "verifier": "tests"}, {"severity": "LOW", "description": "The Auto_Loan source table has no downstream table or function, and no test references it. AutoLoanLeakTest only scans _LoanPaymentsSource for AL- loan ids and does not exercise the Auto_Loan ingestion.", "location": "loan-payments.sqrl", "verifier": "tests"}, {"severity": "LOW", "description": "The Loan_Application source table is ingested but never referenced downstream and has no test coverage.", "location": "loan-payments.sqrl", "verifier": "tests"}, {"severity": "LOW", "description": "The Consumer_Loan_Delinquency_Event source table is ingested but never referenced downstream and has no test coverage.", "location": "loan-payments.sqrl", "verifier": "tests"}, {"severity": "LOW", "description": "The setup block's guard and comment reference the lending/cards_consumer_credit/testdata fixture path, which belongs to a different domain than this cons_loans (consumer-loans) project. The suite may depend on loan fixtures that this script neither verifies nor explicitly fetches, so a clean-checkout run is not guaranteed to have the needed data.", "location": "run-tests.sh", "verifier": "tests"}], "cost_usd": 0.018557375999999997, "duration_ms": 26315}
